(GATES BEFORE TAGGING) Tj T*
(The quality report and the security report must both say PASS.) Tj T*
(CI must be green on the exact commit that will be tagged.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(ROLLBACK PLAN) Tj T*
(Every release note states how to roll back: which previous tag to redeploy) Tj T*
(and whether any database migration must be reverted first.) Tj T*
(A rollback drill is rehearsed once per quarter on a staging copy.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(ANNOUNCEMENT) Tj T*
(After tagging, the delivery lead posts a short release note to the client) Tj T*
(thread listing the version, the highlights and any action the client must take.) Tj T*
ET
